WEBVTT

00:10:58.575 --> 00:11:00.590
was thinking when I saw her smiling

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.851
at those early paintings one day

00:11:02.851 --> 00:11:05.922
in the galleries.

00:11:05.922 --> 00:11:08.288
Even if we created utopias, I believe

00:11:08.288 --> 00:11:11.590
we would still have the incomplete.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.754
Completion is a goal,

00:11:13.754 --> 00:11:17.747
but we hope it is never the end.

00:11:17.747 --> 00:11:20.528
Thank you.

00:11:20.528 --> 00:11:24.384
(Applause)